5,0,1,talk,Misaki,,I will remain objective and ask direct questions to clarify positions.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I am nervous, but I will listen carefully to everyone's logic.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
