10,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Midori, how do you propose we establish a baseline for behavior?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,I think we should just agree to be honest and not lie.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
