13,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, that is a valid point. Logic is the only reliable tool here.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Midori,,"@Misaki, I suggest we simply share our feelings and listen without judgment first.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Ryuji, do you have a specific method for identifying deception?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
