17,0,3,talk,Asuka,,I will track who changes their story or avoids direct answers.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will look for statements that are logically impossible or self-contradictory.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Midori,,I will observe who seems uncomfortable or defensive when asked questions.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Misaki,,Understood. Let us proceed with these approaches in mind.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,"Okay, I will do my best to stay calm and attentive.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Asuka,,Agreed. Let us see who holds up under scrutiny.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
